Z||000002||batboy||09-19-1999||10:42 AM||||Some of the links, especially the stereo links, are messed up on your pages. From personal experience, the links are the hardest to get working right on a new website. I can't believe you're going to put a 12" sub behind the seat! Good luck. I thought that it was a big enough challenge getting an 8 incher to fit. Are you sure you can make a box big enough to handle that 12 incher, without cutting into the firewall, which I don't recommend? <P>BTW, I have an 8" sub in two of my Fieros and will be putting one in my third one too. It's purely personal opinion (and I'm far from offended), but a good 8" sub, such as the Rockford-Fosgate, do not suck. I've had nothing but favorable comments about my set up in the Batmobile. Of course it's not that huge ghetto THUMP, but it does give me a great bass punch and blends in nicely with the rest of the music. Inside that little Fiero cockpit, it's all I need. I don't really want the whole car and all the windows rattling when I have the stereo on.||||reg||1
Z||000003||yellowFormula||09-19-1999||08:56 PM||||Thanks for the feedback batboy, you don't remember which links are messed up by any chance do you? I have been fixing and re-uploading pages left and right fixing links, I thought I fixed the problems but I guess not.  Oh and I just put the sub in this weekend, sounds GREAT for 1 12" sub. I was going to do two 8"s behind each seat but I couldnt find a good price on 8" subs, and I got this 12" for super cheap, in a box too. I usually dont have anyone in my passengers seat anyway so I don't really care about it having to be all the way up, and no I didnt cut the firewall or the carpet, tempted though.<P><BR>-jeff||||reg||1
Z||000004||batboy||09-19-1999||09:35 PM||||Well, I'm amazed you got that sub to fit. Your Fiero will be a rockin' now. I heard those solo-baric subs work good, but seems like they require a big amp for best performance.<P>The bad links are on your "My Projects" page. They included: current stereo, future stereo, future stereo part 2. No big deal. I had lots of link problems too.||||reg||1
